Package: MNIeffect
Title: Lavaan Wrapper for Effect Sizes of Measurement Non-Invariance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tizian", "Schuhbeck", , "t.schuhbeck@gmx.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package implements the effect size measures of measurement non-invariance defined in Schuhbeck et al. (2026) for linear common factor models with (jointly) normally distributed factors.
